      "question_id": "q-06-03",
      "section_id": "06-cost-total-cost-of-ownership",
      "canonical_question": "How did that final TCO compare to what you had budgeted or expected at the beginning of the project?"
    },
    {
      "question_id": "q-06-04",
      "section_id": "06-cost-total-cost-of-ownership",
      "canonical_question": "So the total cost of ownership ended up roughly 20-30% higher than your initial expectations, primarily due to underestimating the internal labor required for testing and validation. Is that accurate?"
    },
