      "question_id": "q-06-07",
      "section_id": "06-cost-total-cost-of-ownership",
      "canonical_question": "So the main surprises were around licensing—modules you thought were included in the core package, like GRC and parts of change management, turned out to be additional line items. Is that correct?"
